    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Nestled within the highly sought-after Woodland’s development in Frankfield, No. 15 is a four-bedroom detached residence with garage offering spacious, light-filled accommodation and superb family living. The property benefits from mature front and rear gardens and is ideal for anyone looking for that bit of extra space, both inside and out. Well-maintained throughout, the home enjoys a practical layout designed to cater to family life, with generously proportioned reception rooms and comfortable bedroom accommodation. Situated in a quiet, established residential setting, the property combines privacy and convenience. \r\n\r\nLocated in the mature and highly desirable suburb of Frankfield, which enjoys an enviable setting just minutes from Cork City Centre, Cork Airport, and the South Ring Road network, providing excellent connectivity to all parts of the city and beyond. The area is renowned for its family-friendly atmosphere and abundance of amenities, with a selection of highly regarded primary and secondary schools. Residents benefit from convenient access to Douglas Village, Mahon Point Shopping Centre, and a range of local services, making this an ideal location for modern family living. Combining a peaceful residential environment with exceptional convenience, Woodlands remains one of the most sought-after addresses on Cork's south side.\r\n\r\nGround Floor\r\n\r\nHallway – 3.6m x 1.7m \r\nParquet flooring\r\n\r\nLiving Room – 5.2m x 4.0m \r\nFeature fireplace, parquet flooring \r\n\r\nDining Room – 7.6m x 3.4m \r\nTimber flooring and carpet floor covering, fitted shelving units\r\n\r\nKitchen 4.9m x 3.2m \r\nRange of fitted kitchen appliances, timber flooring, door to rear\r\n\r\nWC – 1.7m x 1.6m\r\nWC, wash hand basin\r\n\r\nSunroom – 3.5m x 2.4m \r\nSliding door to rear, tiled flooring\r\n\r\nGarage – 7.0m x 3.5m \r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 – 4.0m x 3.5m \r\nCarpet floor covering\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 – 3.5m x 3.4m \r\nCarpet floor covering\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 – 4.0m x 2.5m \r\nCarpet floor covering, fitted wardrobes\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 – 3.0m x 2.3m \r\nCarpet floor covering, fitted wardrobes\r\n\r\nBathroom – 2.4m x 1.7m \r\nWC, Wash hand basin, bath with shower, tiled floor"
      },
      {
